            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 6:58 p.m. Central Daylight Time Sunday, Environment Canada has issued a tornado warning for Westman and Parkland Manitoba. Extra care and attention should be exercised in and around the following localities: Virden, Kenton, Ellice-Archie, Birdtail Sioux and Birdtail Creek 57 Reserve. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds and large hail are also possible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches. Please consult local media for more information.</value>
